<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Laboratório 3D Ultra-HD de Robótica & Física Solar</title>
    
    <!-- Tailwind CSS -->
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    
    <!-- FontAwesome Icons & Google Fonts -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    
    <!-- Three.js, OrbitControls & GSAP -->
    <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js"></script>
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/three@0.128.0/examples/js/controls/OrbitControls.js"></script>
    <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js"></script>
    
    <!-- Chart.js for Live Graphing -->
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chart.js"></script>

    <!-- KaTeX for LaTeX Math -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/katex@0.16.8/dist/katex.min.css">
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/katex@0.16.8/dist/katex.min.js"></script>
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/katex@0.16.8/dist/contrib/auto-render.min.js"></script>

    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            overflow: hidden;
            background-color: #030712;
            user-select: none;
        }
        .font-mono { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; }
        
        /* Custom Scrollbar */
        ::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 5px; height: 5px; }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.8); }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.5); border-radius: 4px; }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover { background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.8); }

        /* Glassmorphic Panels */
        .glass-panel {
            background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.85);
            backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        }
        .glass-card {
            background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.5);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
        }

        /* LCD 16x2 Emulation */
        .lcd-display {
            background-color: #1a3a2a;
            color: #33ff77;
            font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
            box-shadow: inset 0 0 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);
            text-shadow: 0 0 4px rgba(51, 255, 119, 0.6);
        }

        .thermal-tint-active {
            box-shadow: inset 0 0 120px rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.25);
        }

        /* Glow animation */
        @keyframes pulse-glow {
            0%, 100% { opacity: 0.4; }
            50% { opacity: 0.9; }
        }
        .animate-glow { animation: pulse-glow 2s infinite ease-in-out; }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="text-slate-100 h-screen w-screen relative overflow-hidden select-none">

    <!-- 3D WebGL Canvas Viewport -->
    <div id="canvas-container" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full z-0 cursor-grab active:cursor-grabbing"></div>

    <!-- Thermal / InfraRed Overlay Filter -->
    <div id="thermal-overlay" class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none z-10 transition-all duration-500 opacity-0 border-4 border-red-500/20"></div>

    <!-- Header Overlay -->
    <header class="absolute top-0 left-0 right-0 z-20 p-4 flex justify-between items-center pointer-events-none">
        <div class="glass-panel px-4 py-2.5 rounded-2xl pointer-events-auto flex items-center gap-3 shadow-2xl border border-slate-700/60">
            <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-600 to-cyan-500 p-2.5 rounded-xl text-white shadow-lg shadow-blue-500/20">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-microchip text-xl"></i>
            </div>
            <div>
                <h1 class="font-extrabold text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-100 flex items-center gap-2">
                    Robótica & Física Solar <span class="bg-blue-500/20 text-blue-400 text-xs px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full border border-blue-500/30 font-semibold">PBR 3D Ultra-HD</span>
                </h1>
                <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Simulador Fototérmico, Infravermelho & Automação Arduino</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Camera Focus Hotspots & IR Mode -->
        <div class="glass-panel px-3 py-1.5 rounded-2xl pointer-events-auto flex items-center gap-2 shadow-2xl">
            <div class="hidden lg:flex items-center gap-1 border-r border-slate-800 pr-2 mr-1">
                <span class="text-xs text-slate-400 mr-1"><i class="fa-solid fa-eye text-blue-400 mr-1"></i>Foco:</span>
                <button onclick="focusCamera('overview')" class="px-2.5 py-1 text-xs bg-slate-800/80 hover:bg-blue-600/30 hover:text-blue-300 text-slate-300 rounded-lg border border-slate-700/60 transition">Visão Geral</button>
                <button onclick="focusCamera('arduino')" class="px-2.5 py-1 text-xs bg-slate-800/80 hover:bg-blue-600/30 hover:text-blue-300 text-slate-300 rounded-lg border border-slate-700/60 transition">Arduino & Circuitos</button>
                <button onclick="focusCamera('pool')" class="px-2.5 py-1 text-xs bg-slate-800/80 hover:bg-blue-600/30 hover:text-blue-300 text-slate-300 rounded-lg border border-slate-700/60 transition">Piscina & Sonda</button>
                <button onclick="focusCamera('panel')" class="px-2.5 py-1 text-xs bg-slate-800/80 hover:bg-blue-600/30 hover:text-blue-300 text-slate-300 rounded-lg border border-slate-700/60 transition">Painel Fotovoltaico</button>
            </div>

            <!-- IR Infrared Camera Mode -->
            <button id="btn-thermal" onclick="toggleThermalVision()" class="px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold rounded-xl bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-amber-400 border border-amber-500/30 transition flex items-center gap-1.5 shadow">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-fire-flame-curved"></i>
                <span id="label-thermal">Visão Térmica (IR)</span>
            </button>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Floating Component Interactive Tooltip -->
    <div id="tooltip" class="absolute z-30 pointer-events-none transition-all duration-300 opacity-0 transform translate-y-2 hidden">
        <div class="glass-panel p-3.5 rounded-2xl border border-blue-500/40 shadow-2xl max-w-xs text-xs">
            <div id="tooltip-title" class="font-bold text-blue-400 text-sm mb-1 flex items-center justify-between">
                <span>Componente</span>
                <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info text-blue-400 text-xs"></i>
            </div>
            <div id="tooltip-desc" class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">Detalhes do componente no circuito.</div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Live LCD Screen Overlay (Bottom-Left) -->
    <div class="absolute bottom-5 left-5 z-20 pointer-events-auto">
        <div class="glass-panel p-3.5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-700/80 shadow-2xl w-80">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2">
                <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-300 flex items-center gap-1.5">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-desktop text-emerald-400"></i> LCD 16x2 I2C Telemetria
                </span>
                <span class="flex items-center gap-1">
                    <span id="status-dot" class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 animate-pulse"></span>
                    <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-emerald-400">ONLINE</span>
                </span>
            </div>
            <div class="lcd-display p-3 rounded-xl font-mono text-xs font-bold tracking-widest border border-emerald-900/50">
                <div id="lcd-line-1">TEMP:24.5C SOL:1000W</div>
                <div id="lcd-line-2">VOLT:4.85V P:14.5W</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- IR Virtual Remote Control (Bottom-Center) -->
    <div class="absolute bottom-5 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 z-20 pointer-events-auto">
        <div class="glass-panel px-4 py-2.5 rounded-2xl border border-amber-500/30 shadow-2xl flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-amber-400 flex items-center gap-1.5">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-remote"></i> Controle IR:
            </span>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
                <button onclick="sendIRCommand('HEAT_ON')" class="px-2.5 py-1 text-xs bg-red-600/80 hover:bg-red-500 text-white rounded-lg font-medium transition shadow">Ligar Aquec.</button>
                <button onclick="sendIRCommand('HEAT_OFF')" class="px-2.5 py-1 text-xs bg-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-600 text-slate-200 rounded-lg font-medium transition">Desligar</button>
                <button onclick="sendIRCommand('MODE_AUTO')" class="px-2.5 py-1 text-xs bg-amber-600/80 hover:bg-amber-500 text-white rounded-lg font-medium transition">Modo Auto</button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Toggle Controls Panel Button -->
    <div class="absolute top-20 right-5 z-20">
        <button id="btn-toggle-sidebar" onclick="toggleSidebar()" class="glass-panel px-4 py-2.5 rounded-2xl text-xs font-semibold text-blue-400 hover:text-blue-300 border border-slate-700/80 shadow-2xl flex items-center gap-2 transition hover:bg-slate-800/80">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-sliders text-sm"></i>
            <span>Painel & Teoria</span>
        </button>
    </div>

    <!-- Sidebar Window (Simulation Controls, Didactic Material & Real-Time Graphs) -->
    <aside id="sidebar" class="absolute top-0 right-0 bottom-0 w-full sm:w-[480px] z-30 glass-panel border-l border-slate-800 p-5 overflow-y-auto flex flex-col transition-transform duration-300 transform translate-x-0 shadow-2xl">
        
        <!-- Header -->
        <div class="flex justify-between items-center pb-4 mb-4 border-b border-slate-800">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
                <div class="p-2 rounded-xl bg-blue-500/20 text-blue-400 border border-blue-500/30">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-flask-vial text-base"></i>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h2 class="font-bold text-slate-100 text-sm">Laboratório Didático</h2>
                    <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400">Controles & Fundamentação Teórica</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <button onclick="toggleSidebar()" class="text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-100 p-2 rounded-xl hover:bg-slate-800 transition">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-xmark text-lg"></i>
            </button>
        </div>

        <!-- Navigation Tabs -->
        <div class="flex bg-slate-900/90 p-1 rounded-xl mb-4 border border-slate-800 text-xs font-medium">
            <button onclick="switchTab('sim')" id="tab-btn-sim" class="flex-1 py-2 rounded-lg transition text-blue-400 bg-slate-800 shadow">Simulador</button>
            <button onclick="switchTab('t6')" id="tab-btn-t6" class="flex-1 py-2 rounded-lg transition text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-200">6. Temp</button>
            <button onclick="switchTab('t7')" id="tab-btn-t7" class="flex-1 py-2 rounded-lg transition text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-200">7. Luz/IR</button>
            <button onclick="switchTab('t8')" id="tab-btn-t8" class="flex-1 py-2 rounded-lg transition text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-200">8. Fotov.</button>
            <button onclick="switchTab('t9')" id="tab-btn-t9" class="flex-1 py-2 rounded-lg transition text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-200">9. Piscina</button>
        </div>

        <!-- TAB CONTENT: SIMULATOR CONTROLS & LIVE GRAPH -->
        <div id="tab-content-sim" class="space-y-4 flex-1">
            <!-- Sun & Radiation Controls -->
            <div class="glass-card p-4 rounded-2xl space-y-3.5">
                <h3 class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-200 uppercase tracking-wider flex items-center justify-between">
                    <span class="flex items-center gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-sun text-amber-400 text-sm"></i> Radiação Solar & Ambiente</span>
                    <span id="ir-beam-indicator" class="text-[10px] px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-300 border border-amber-500/30">Feixe IR Ativo</span>
                </h3>
                
                <!-- Sun Angle Slider -->
                <div>
                    <div class="flex justify-between text-xs mb-1.5">
                        <span class="text-slate-400">Posição Angular do Sol ($\theta$)</span>
                        <span id="val-sun-angle" class="font-mono text-blue-400 font-bold">45°</span>
                    </div>
                    <input type="range" id="slider-sun-angle" min="5" max="175" value="45" class="w-full accent-blue-500 bg-slate-800 h-2 rounded-lg cursor-pointer">
                </div>

                <!-- Sun Irradiance Slider -->
                <div>
                    <div class="flex justify-between text-xs mb-1.5">
                        <span class="text-slate-400">Irradiância Solar Directa ($G$)</span>
                        <span id="val-sun-intensity" class="font-mono text-amber-400 font-bold">1000 W/m²</span>
                    </div>
                    <input type="range" id="slider-sun-intensity" min="0" max="1200" value="1000" step="50" class="w-full accent-amber-500 bg-slate-800 h-2 rounded-lg cursor-pointer">
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Photovoltaic Panel & Pump Actuators -->
            <div class="glass-card p-4 rounded-2xl space-y-3.5">
                <h3 class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-200 uppercase tracking-wider flex items-center gap-2">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-gears text-blue-400 text-sm"></i> Atuadores & Maqueta Robótica
                </h3>

                <!-- Pump Toggle -->
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between bg-slate-900/60 p-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-800">
                    <div>
                        <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-200 flex items-center gap-1.5">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-water-ladders text-sky-400"></i> Bomba Térmica de Circulação
                        </div>
                        <div class="text-[10px] text-slate-400">Transferência de calor para a piscina</div>
                    </div>
                    <label class="relative inline-flex items-center cursor-pointer">
                        <input type="checkbox" id="toggle-pump" class="sr-only peer" checked>
                        <div class="w-11 h-6 bg-slate-800 peer-focus:outline-none rounded-full peer peer-checked:after:translate-x-full peer-checked:after:border-white after:content-[''] after:absolute after:top-[2px] after:left-[2px] after:bg-white after:border-slate-300 after:border after:rounded-full after:h-5 after:w-5 after:transition-all peer-checked:bg-blue-600"></div>
                    </label>
                </div>

                <!-- Solar Panel Tilt Angle -->
                <div>
                    <div class="flex justify-between text-xs mb-1.5">
                        <span class="text-slate-400">Inclinação do Coletor / Painel ($\beta$)</span>
                        <span id="val-panel-tilt" class="font-mono text-blue-400 font-bold">30°</span>
                    </div>
                    <input type="range" id="slider-panel-tilt" min="-45" max="45" value="30" class="w-full accent-blue-500 bg-slate-800 h-2 rounded-lg cursor-pointer">
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Telemetry Dashboard -->
            <div class="glass-card p-4 rounded-2xl space-y-3">
                <h3 class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-200 uppercase tracking-wider flex items-center justify-between">
                    <span class="flex items-center gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-chart-line text-emerald-400 text-sm"></i> Telemetria Térmica & Elétrica</span>
                </h3>

                <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 text-xs">
                    <div class="bg-slate-900/80 p-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-800">
                        <div class="text-slate-400 text-[11px] mb-0.5">Temp. Água (DS18B20)</div>
                        <div id="read-temp" class="text-xl font-bold font-mono text-emerald-400">24.5 °C</div>
                        <div class="text-[10px] text-slate-500 mt-1">12-bit (ΔT = 0,0625°C)</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-slate-900/80 p-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-800">
                        <div class="text-slate-400 text-[11px] mb-0.5">Luminosidade (LDR)</div>
                        <div id="read-ldr" class="text-xl font-bold font-mono text-amber-400">1.20 kΩ</div>
                        <div id="read-lux" class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 mt-1">~8500 Lux</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-slate-900/80 p-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-800">
                        <div class="text-slate-400 text-[11px] mb-0.5">Tensão Gerada ($V_{oc}$)</div>
                        <div id="read-volt" class="text-xl font-bold font-mono text-sky-400">4.85 V</div>
                        <div id="read-power" class="text-[10px] text-sky-300 mt-1">Potência: 14.5 W</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-slate-900/80 p-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-800">
                        <div class="text-slate-400 text-[11px] mb-0.5">Calor Absorvido ($Q$)</div>
                        <div id="read-heat" class="text-xl font-bold font-mono text-purple-400">52.3 kJ</div>
                        <div class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 mt-1">Rendimento Térmico: ~72%</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Chart.js Live Graph -->
            <div class="glass-card p-4 rounded-2xl">
                <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-300 mb-2 flex items-center justify-between">
                    <span><i class="fa-solid fa-chart-area text-blue-400 mr-1.5"></i> Gráfico em Tempo Real</span>
                    <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-500 font-mono">Atualização: 1s</span>
                </h4>
                <div class="w-full h-44">
                    <canvas id="liveChart"></canvas>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- TAB CONTENT: TOPIC 6 (TEMPERATURE SENSORS) -->
        <div id="tab-content-t6" class="hidden space-y-4 flex-1 text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-300">
            <div class="border-b border-slate-800 pb-3">
                <h3 class="font-bold text-sm text-blue-400 flex items-center gap-2">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-temperature-high"></i> 6. Sensores de Temperatura: Medição do Aquecimento
                </h3>
                <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 mt-0.5">Foco: Física das medidas, sensoriamento e robótica aplicada</p>
            </div>

            <div class="space-y-3">
                <div class="glass-card p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-800">
                    <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-100 text-xs mb-1.5 text-blue-300 flex items-center gap-1.5">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-bolt-lightning"></i> Como o sensor transforma grandeza física em sinal elétrico?
                    </h4>
                    <p>O sensor **DS18B20** aproveita a dependência da temperatura na tensão de *bandgap* de uma junção PN de silício interna. Um conversor analógico-digital (ADC) interno de 12 bits codifica essa variação térmica diretamente em pulsos seriais binários através do protocolo **1-Wire**.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="glass-card p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-800">
                    <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-100 text-xs mb-1.5 text-blue-300 flex items-center gap-1.5">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-network-wired"></i> Medição Multiponto (Barramento 1-Wire)
                    </h4>
                    <p>Cada sensor DS18B20 possui um endereço físico gravado a laser de 64 bits único. Isso permite conectar **vários sensores no mesmo pino de dados do Arduino** (ex: entrada da tubulação, interior da piscina e saída do coletor solar), economizando portas no microcontrolador.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="glass-card p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-800">
                    <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-100 text-xs mb-1.5 text-blue-300">Precisão vs Resolução vs Tempo de Resposta</h4>
                    <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1.5 text-slate-300">
                        <li><b>Precisão (Accuracy):</b> Quão próximo a leitura está do valor real (±0,5°C de -10°C a +85°C).</li>
                        <li><b>Resolução:</b> A menor variação detectável. No DS18B20 em 12 bits, a resolução é de **0,0625°C**.</li>
                        <li><b>Tempo de Resposta & Inércia Térmica:</b> A cápsula de aço inoxidável e a resina de impermeabilização geram um retardo térmico ($\tau \approx 2$ a $5$s em líquidos).</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div class="glass-card p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-800">
                    <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-100 text-xs mb-1.5 text-blue-300">Algoritmo de Decisão de Aquecimento</h4>
                    <p class="mb-2">O Arduino lê a temperatura da água da piscina ($T_{piscina}$) e da saída do coletor solar ($T_{coletor}$). A bomba só é acionada se:</p>
                    <div class="bg-slate-950 p-2 rounded border border-slate-800 text-center font-mono text-emerald-400">
                        $$T_{coletor} - T_{piscina} > \Delta T_{limite} \quad (\Delta T_{limite} \approx 5^\circ\text{C})$$
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- TAB CONTENT: TOPIC 7 (LIGHT & IR SENSORS) -->
        <div id="tab-content-t7" class="hidden space-y-4 flex-1 text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-300">
            <div class="border-b border-slate-800 pb-3">
                <h3 class="font-bold text-sm text-amber-400 flex items-center gap-2">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-sun"></i> 7. Sensores de Luz & Radiação Solar / Infravermelho
                </h3>
                <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 mt-0.5">Foco: Radiação eletromagnética e foto-detectores</p>
            </div>

            <div class="space-y-3">
                <div class="glass-card p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-800">
                    <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-100 text-xs mb-1.5 text-amber-300">Funcionamento do LDR (Sulfeto de Cádmio)</h4>
                    <p>O LDR baseia-se no efeito fotocondutivo: quando fótons de energia $h\nu > E_g$ incidem no semicondutor, elétrons saltam para a banda de condução, reduzindo drasticamente a resistência elétrica:</p>
                    <div class="bg-slate-950 p-2 rounded border border-slate-800 text-center font-mono text-amber-400 my-2">
                        $$R_{LDR} = \frac{R_{escuro}}{E^\gamma}$$
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="glass-card p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-800">
                    <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-100 text-xs mb-1.5 text-amber-300">Sensor Infravermelho (TSOP / Fototransistor)</h4>
                    <p>A radiação térmica emitida pelo Sol situa-se predominantemente no espectro **Infravermelho (IR)**. Os receptores IR utilizam um filtro óptico para bloquear a luz visível e um circuito demodulador em **38 kHz**, permitindo comunicação remota e medição irradiativa sem interferência ambiente.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="glass-card p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-800">
                    <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-100 text-xs mb-1.5 text-amber-300">Rastreamento Solar Dual-Axis (Solar Tracker)</h4>
                    <p>Ao utilizar dois LDRs separados por uma divisória opaca, o Arduino compara as tensões no divisor de tensão. Se $V_{LDR1} \neq V_{LDR2}$, os servomotores ajustam o ângulo do painel até recalibrar o ponto de máxima irradiância.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- TAB CONTENT: TOPIC 8 (PHOTOVOLTAIC PANELS) -->
